"Нат числа"
 "Объявления функций арифметики десятичных рациональных чисел"
 Declaration + (Nat Nat Nat) fm_Nadd. 
 Declaration - (Nat Nat Nat) fm_Nminus. 
 Declaration * (Nat Nat Nat) fm_Nmult. 
 Declaration / (Nat Nat Nat) fm_Ndev. 
 "арифм-отношения"
 Declaration = (TV Nat Nat) fm_Neq. 
 Declaration < (TV Nat Nat) fm_Nlt.

"скос"
 Declaration = (TV Fseq Fseq) fm_Seq.
 Declaration < (TV Fseq Fseq) fm_Slt.
 Declaration lng(N Fseq) fm_Slng.
